OL,3,GNEWSACould Gloucester leadership
OL,4,Adeadlock be broken?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leaderless city council is due to get
OL,7,Fanother chance to decide who should get
OL,8,Fthe top job.
OL,10,FGloucester City Council has been
OL,11,Fwithout anybody at the helm since
OL,12,FSeptember when the previous Liberal
OL,13,FDemocrat leader Jeremy Hilton was
OL,14,Fousted by a vote of no confidence.
OL,16,FA meeting on Thursday will be the final
OL,17,Fchance of the year for councillors to
OL,18,Fformally agree who should take over.
OL,19,FHilton, and his deputy Declan Wilson,
OL,20,Fhave said the party is "ready to
OL,21,Fresume" leading the city.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
