OL,3,GNEWSACould Gloucester leadership
OL,4,Adeadlock be broken?
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative councillors said an
OL,7,Fagreement for a new leader could be
OL,8,F"imminent" and implied they would
OL,9,Fconsider backing an alternative Lib Dem
OL,10,Fto the ousted Hilton ` describing him
OL,11,Fas the "one red line" they would not
OL,12,Fcross.
